libplacebo 編成靜態函式庫時不要把 pl_* 標成 dllexport

libplacebo 7.360.1 的 src/meson.build 不論共用或靜態函式庫都定義 PL_EXPORT（__declspec(dllexport)），
靜態連結進 libmpv-2.dll 後，DLL 會多匯出 470 個 pl_* 函式。靜態建置改定義 PL_STATIC（PL_API 為空）。

--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -245,7 +245,8 @@
 ### Main library build process
 inc = include_directories('./include')
 lib = library('placebo', sources,
-  c_args: ['-DPL_EXPORT'],
+  # A static libplacebo linked into another DLL must not export pl_* from it
+  c_args: get_option('default_library') == 'static' ? ['-DPL_STATIC'] : ['-DPL_EXPORT'],
   install: true,
   dependencies: build_deps + glad_dep,
   soversion: apiver,
